## UI Todos

Make the UX feel seamless

- [ ] Make UX for search better
  - [ ] Add shift + click and ctrl + click for easier checkbox selection
  - [ ] Make key name be `<label />` for checkbox for easy selection
- [ ] Have better onboarding and help UX
  - [ ] Add a custom onboarding flow to help users understand bhow to use the
        app
  - [ ] Create a help menu button that users can click on to view a modal of
        FAQs and troubleshooting. For example, if they run into an issue like
        "No profile selected", that means that data was corrupted, so we should
        direct them to
        `chrome://settings/content/siteDetails?site=https%3A%2F%2Fvarstash.com`
        and tell them to first export any secrets they own, then delete their
        site data and then refresh the page to start anew.

